The core has no third-party runtime dependencies. Optional parts have their own:
- engines/python uses claude-agent-sdk when installed (MIT licence);
- engines/go uses only the Go standard library;
- cloud/connector uses only Web APIs available in Cloudflare Workers.

Each optional part degrades cleanly when its dependency is missing.

"seo-autopilot" is the project's name. See TRADEMARK.md for how to use it.
